# expect: approval record must be a model element, an IRI with arch:inModel
# 2026-11-22 invalid: an IRI approval record outside every model (no arch:inModel; not under {base}model/, so the
# MembershipShape, which checks model-namespace IRIs only, does not report it).
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix arch: <https://meta.linked.archi/core#> .
@prefix am4:  <https://meta.linked.archi/archimate4/onto#> .
@prefix aisep: <https://aisep.example/ont/aisep#> .
@prefix : <https://aisep.example/model/t/> .
:t a arch:Model ; skos:prefLabel "测试模型"@zh .
:ac a am4:ApplicationComponent ; arch:inModel :t ; skos:prefLabel "组件"@zh .
:boss a arch:Stakeholder ; arch:inModel :t ; skos:prefLabel "架构师"@zh .
:bot a arch:Stakeholder ; arch:inModel :t ; skos:prefLabel "编码代理"@zh .
<https://elsewhere.example/rec> a aisep:ApprovalRecord ; aisep:gate aisep:GateMerge ; aisep:decision aisep:DecisionApproved ; aisep:approvedBy :boss ; aisep:approves :ac ; aisep:evidence "sha256:abababababababababababababababababababababababababababababababab" ; prov:generatedAtTime "2026-11-20T11:00:00+08:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
